    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Strange attractors are fractals: their box-counting (capacity) dimension D_0 and correlation dimension D_2 are non-integers, quantifying how densely (or sparsely) the attractor fills the space it lives in. Covering the attractor with boxes of side \epsilon and counting the occupied boxes N(\epsilon),">

